 $P$ is given below. What are its **non**-pivot columns?\n\n$$\nP=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 6 & -1 & 1 & 8 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 2 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "Remember that the pivots of a matrix in row echelon form are the first non-zero entries in each row of the matrix.\n\nWe can see that $P$ has $3$ pivots in the $2$nd, $4$th and $5$th columns:\n\n$$\nP=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 6 & -1 & 1 & 8 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 2 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the only non-pivot columns are the $1$st and $3$rd column."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186342035 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186124478 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "a5f0d2e9-1cf6-5fe4-85cc-f401382f39b2" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Non-Pivot Columns of a Matrix in Row Echelon Form"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "aa7c4e56-6bb8-5168-9b66-41a030b85693" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186574519} {:answer/id #uuid "11a9b7ba-2495-53a4-91bc-98d4d18ae422" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186574520}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "aa7c4e56-6bb8-5168-9b66-41a030b85693" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186574519} :answer-field/id #uuid "587d687d-d214-5b3c-979e-b02b8593e0ac" :answer-field/key "Column 1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186574742} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ec1b8c11-1ce8-5b3a-9694-089ca672de56" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186574521} {:answer/id #uuid "801657e4-7d44-5075-a98b-cbb1a36a98a8" :ans