∼\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 5\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLooking at the row echelon form, we see that $P$ has $3$ pivots. In particular, the pivot columns are the $1$st, $3$rd, and $4$th columns."}]}
